@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Every response has a generated request id
GET {{base}}/orders

### 2. Caller-supplied request id is honoured unchanged
GET {{base}}/orders
x-request-id: mine-123

### 3. Error response includes the same non-null request id
GET {{base}}/orders/99999
x-request-id: error-check-123

### 4. Missing API key on protected DELETE -> 401
DELETE {{base}}/orders/1

### 5. Wrong API key on protected DELETE -> 403
DELETE {{base}}/orders/1
x-api-key: wrong

### 6. Correct API key on protected DELETE -> 204
# Set API_KEY in the terminal to the same value you send here.
DELETE {{base}}/orders/1
x-api-key: change-this-local-development-key

### 7. @Roles("staff") blocks a caller without a staff identity -> 403
GET {{base}}/orders/staff-only

### 8. Logging interceptor includes route/controller/method/duration/request id
GET {{base}}/orders/2
x-request-id: logging-check-7

### 9. Timeout interceptor: this deliberately waits six seconds and must return 408
GET {{base}}/orders/slow

### 10. ParseAreaPipe normalises lowercase
GET {{base}}/orders?area=bole

### 11. ParseAreaPipe normalises uppercase
GET {{base}}/orders?area=BOLE

### 12. ParseAreaPipe rejects an unknown area with 400
GET {{base}}/orders?area=adama
